<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-19T11:00:49.170Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:00:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;A top Jalisco cartel leader known as El Jardinero was arrested, and a hitman from the same cartel confessed to carrying out hundreds of executions at a ranch. Police officers were injured while defending Jalisco's Government Palace during a protest demanding clean water. Ukrainian-origin fiber-optic drones have been reported operating with Mexican narco groups. The conflict produced 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1mRFYxTDFEdG5OV1JvTUdxLVBwUTFGd2JzRllMTFlJczZmbnFxbk1HTVFZbWNxOTZXa1NkM3lOZFRJbGRfcWs1VlEtd0ltNVhRcFVTaWprS3dUX0ltcVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQUGg4TVFTRjBuc1ROZTRIVWg5NzNvS0NYU0plQWVmckw4S2lZenhrbVp6SE1mYlMtTW5sazVEenVtd0pzb0NzOWhDbmROdGtlVC11M0VvWUJxSUtfSmdxNlJrZ1hRNmlpNTBFNG1GM0V2QzFmRHUtQjVCeHlUZTd0aVZmTDhjeDFVWlVtTlFJV1liQkxBUnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;CBS News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPc3ZfRVpaa0l4RGVOdTBfbTdZYXdNMHdTbkxZZXd1OUtMcjduX2VsVUtENU1iZXFJaTVHZG9oS3pBTEl4aDk4cHgybS1hUGFuQWNEdHJaZkRSa2J5Z2J6NFVUZWczUWJqc1VDSV9RSFdvcDB1WlBXSFBWTGVBaHpSR3NXQ2pjUHpjaEpZNVVqTk9wZV90bktGcmFmU0pSTHNDbkl6TFpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNWWI2QmpPUzhJMlpKWmQzVkM5TWthMzh3Qnd1dHl5c0FXZTJIT1pFUFRyMUs3bnMxRk5xUDRNSTc2ZTBVdGxiZ0lrSW5Ycnd5aVJfa3Q5WHVHVjNMWXcwQjZIQjVfdTZhUng0QmFPOHk1enZYazBNSU55UWh6SXdIbGg1Zl9SRzYtWk1IY0JpVC04bjhfSzlrU3poYlNFUEQ0Uy1MLUZWY0JwZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Free Malaysia Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE43Z05jbmZrLT